Instance:  DocumentAccessProvider
InstanceOf: ActorDefinition
Title:   "Document Access Provider"
Usage:  #definition

* name = "DocumentAccessProvider"
* type = http://hl7.org/fhir/examplescenario-actor-type#system
* status = http://hl7.org/fhir/publication-status#draft
* description = """
A grouping of the Document Registry and Document Repository, indexing document metadata and serving document content to Document Consumers. Other names include Electronic Document Management Systems (EDMS) and IHE XDS. See [Health Data API (HIE/EURIDICE) - Actors](HIE.html#actors).
"""
* documentation = """
Examples in this IG include the NHS England National Record Locator (NRL), acting as Document Registry, and the NHS England Genomics Core Broker / Unified Genomic Record (UGR), acting as Document Repository - see [ctDNA NHS England Unified Genomic Record (UGR) - Phase 1](ctDNAUGR.html#phase-1-pdf-report--nrl-pointer).
"""
